{"parse":{"title":"Moonlight, Lent Unto You","pageid":430087,"revid":2168043,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Moonlight, Lent Unto You</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f6/Talent_Moonlight%2C_Lent_Unto_You.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185700\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Moonlight, Lent Unto You\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f6/Talent_Moonlight%2C_Lent_Unto_You.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185700\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f6/Talent_Moonlight%2C_Lent_Unto_You.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185700 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f6/Talent_Moonlight%2C_Lent_Unto_You.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185700 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Moonlight, Lent Unto You\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Moonlight%2C_Lent_Unto_You.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Moonlight, Lent Unto You.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign_Benediction_Passive\" title=\"Moonsign Benediction Passive\">Moonsign Benediction Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When a <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> member triggers an <a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Charged\" title=\"Electro-Charged\">Electro-Charged</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bloom\" title=\"Bloom\">Bloom</a>, or Hydro-<a href=\"/wiki/Crystallize\" title=\"Crystallize\">Crystallize</a> reaction, it will be converted into a <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged\" title=\"Lunar-Charged\">Lunar-Charged</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom\">Lunar-Bloom</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize\">Lunar-Crystallize</a> reaction respectively. Lunar Reaction DMG inflicted by party members gain a Base DMG increase based on Columbina's Max <a href=\"/wiki/HP\" title=\"HP\">HP</a>. For every 1,000 points of Max HP, the Base DMG of Lunar reactions is increased by 0.2%, up to a maximum of 7%.<br /><br />Additionally, when Columbina is in the party, the party's <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Moonsign\">Moonsign</a> will increase by 1 level.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Max_HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max HP\">Max HP</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Reaction_Enhancement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Reaction Enhancement\">Elemental Reaction Enhancement</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Reaction_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Reaction Base DMG Bonus\">Elemental Reaction Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Charged Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Charged Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Bloom Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Crystallize Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Reaction_Enabling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar Reaction Enabling\">Lunar Reaction Enabling</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Moonlight, Lent Unto You</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign_Benediction_Passive\" title=\"Moonsign Benediction Passive\">Moonsign Benediction Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><